.git
.idea
.claude-flow
**/target/**
!**/target/quarkus-app/**
# Re-include the directory itself too: `**/target/**` matches target/quarkus-app as a
# path, and the pattern above matches only what is inside it, so without this line the
# whole fast-jar is left out of the build context and the image's COPY finds nothing.
!**/target/quarkus-app
*.md
